<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Facture {{ invoice.invoiceNumber }} - Aiolia Event</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background: #f4f6f8;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
            color: #232c33;
        }
        .email-wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 24px 12px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .email-card {
            max-width: 640px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(20, 57, 49, 0.08);
        }
        .email-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1F2D3D, #2C3E50 50%, #3498DB);
            padding: 36px 32px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .email-header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 26px;
            letter-spacing: 0.4px;
        }
        .email-body {
            padding: 36px 32px;
            background: #f9fbfa;
        }
        .invoice-details {
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin: 24px 0;
            border: 1px solid rgba(31, 138, 91, 0.15);
        }
        .invoice-details h2 {
            margin: 0 0 16px;
            font-size: 20px;
            color: #1F2D3D;
        }
        .invoice-info {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .invoice-info-item {
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .invoice-info-item strong {
            display: block;
            color: #5c6b73;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }
        .invoice-amounts {
            margin-top: 24px;
            padding-top: 24px;
            border-top: 2px solid #e0e6ea;
        }
        .amount-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 8px 0;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .amount-row.total {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            padding-top: 16px;
            border-top: 2px solid #1F2D3D;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }
        .cta {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 40px 0 16px;
        }
        .cta a {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 14px 40px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1F2D3D, #3498DB);
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-radius: 999px;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
            box-shadow: 0 14px 24px rgba(52, 152, 219, 0.25);
        }
        .footer {
            padding: 28px 32px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #5c6b73;
            background: #ffffff;
        }
        .footer p {
            margin: 6px 0;
        }
        @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            .email-card {
                border-radius: 0;
            }
            .email-header,
            .email-body,
            .footer {
                padding: 28px 20px;
            }
            .invoice-info {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-wrapper">
        <div class="email-card">
            <div class="email-header">
                <h1>📄 Votre facture</h1>
                <p style="margin-top: 10px; opacity: 0.9; font-size: 15px;">
                    Facture N° {{ invoice.invoiceNumber }}
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="email-body">
                <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;">
                    Bonjour {{ customer.firstName }},<br>
                    Vous trouverez ci-joint votre facture pour l'achat de billet(s) d'événement.
                </p>

                <div class="invoice-details">
                    <h2>Détails de la facture</h2>
                    <div class="invoice-info">
                        <div class="invoice-info-item">
                            <strong>Numéro de facture</strong>
                            {{ invoice.invoiceNumber }}
                        </div>
                        <div class="invoice-info-item">
                            <strong>Date d'émission</strong>
                            {{ invoice.issuedAt|date('d/m/Y') }}
                        </div>
                        <div class="invoice-info-item">
                            <strong>Type</strong>
                            Facture de billet
                        </div>
                        <div class="invoice-info-item">
                            <strong>Statut</strong>
                            {% if invoice.status == 'paid' %}
                                Payée
                            {% elseif invoice.status == 'issued' %}
                                Émise
                            {% else %}
                                {{ invoice.status }}
                            {% endif %}
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="invoice-amounts">
                        <div class="amount-row">
                            <span>Sous-total HT:</span>
                            <span>{{ invoice.subtotalAmount|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }} {{ invoice.currency }}</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="amount-row">
                            <span>TVA (20%):</span>
                            <span>{{ invoice.taxAmount|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }} {{ invoice.currency }}</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="amount-row total">
                            <span>Total TTC:</span>
                            <span>{{ invoice.totalAmount|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }} {{ invoice.currency }}</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #304047;">
                    Vous pouvez télécharger votre facture au format PDF depuis votre espace client.
                </p>

                <div class="cta">
                    <a href="{{ absolute_url(path('app_profile_index')) }}">Accéder à mon espace</a>
                </div>

                <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #5c6b73; text-align: center;">
                    Besoin d'aide ? Contactez notre support à <a href="mailto:support@aiolia-event.com" style="color: #1f8a5b; text-decoration: none;">support@aiolia-event.com</a>.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="footer">
                <p>Cet e-mail a été envoyé automatiquement. Merci de ne pas répondre directement.</p>
                <p>&copy; {{ "now"|date("Y") }} Aiolia Event – Tous droits réservés.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

